{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Scanner rule changed \u2192 run tests",
  "description": "When a rule, the lexer or the fix engine changes, run the accuracy corpus, the fix-engine property tests and the review tests.",
  "version": "1",
  "when": {
    "type": "fileEdited",
    "patterns": [
      "src/lib/scanner/**/*.ts",
      "src/lib/review/**/*.ts",
      "src/lib/samples.ts"
    ]
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "A scanner, lexer or fix-engine file changed. Run `npx vitest run src/lib` (it includes accuracy.test.ts and fixEngine.property.test.ts) and fix any failure in the code, not in the test. If a rule now finds something new in the cursed samples, update an expectation only when the new result is more correct, and explain why. For every bug you fix, add a regression test."
  }
}
